<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">fine</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">fine</ansi> command shows your current bail-out
amount while you are being held in a faction jail cell.

Your fine is not fixed — it decays as you serve your sentence.
The longer you sit, the less it costs to walk free early.
Pay the fine with <ansi fg="command">payfine</ansi>.

<ansi fg="yellow">See Also:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">help payfine</ansi>
